        <mxCell id="16" value="&lt;b&gt;LayoutLMv3 Multimodal Backbone&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; 12 Transformer Encoder Layers&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; Joint Text &amp;amp; Visual Patch Attention&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; 2D Spatial Relative Position Bias&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;bull; Multimodal Hidden Dim: d = 768" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;strokeWidth=2.2;fontColor=#1E3A8A;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
